 up running this several\ntimes, eventually with quite long timeouts.  Most of the remaining timeouts were\ndue to thinking loops rather than legitimate reasoning timeouts.  So endless\nloops are a concern with this particular model on thinking runs.  But we see\nmore differences in performance --- exactly 100 more problems were resolved by\nnonthinking-BF16 than thinking-BF16 --- that can't be explained by the 15\nobserved timeouts in the thinking-BF16 run."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"I asked AI to analyze the results and it found two problems."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"h2","properties":{"id":"problem-1-tool-call-parsing","style":"position:relative;"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#problem-1-tool-call-parsing","ariaLabel":"problem 1 tool call parsing permalink","className":["anchor","before"]},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"svg","properties":{"ariaHidden":"true","focusable":"false","height":"16","version":"1.1","viewBox":"0 0 16 16","width":"16"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"path","properties":{"fillRule":"evenodd","d":"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z"},"children":[]}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"Problem 1: Tool-call parsing"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"In thinking mode, llama.cpp is experiencing a malformed tool-call parse crash\nthat is causing a large number of failures.  These failures cause openhands\nto exit."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"I can trigger this behavior using "},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://gist.github.com/edmcman/cc6eb2c8df64bc655564526636dd68ed"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"this\nscript"}]},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"div","properties":{"className":["gatsby-highlight"],"dataLanguage":"text"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"className":["language-text"]},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{"className":["language-text"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"=== firing the same clean real prompt 10 times ===\nPOST http://172.17.0.2:8085/v1/chat/completions x 10\n\n  probe 1: EXTRACTED (str_replace_editor)\n  probe 2: EXTRACTED (str_replace_editor)\n  probe 3: EMPTY (finish_reason=stop, no content, no reasoning)\n  probe 4: EMPTY (finish_reason=stop, no content, no reasoning)\n  probe 5: CRASH (500: Failed to parse input at pos 49: <tool_call>\n<function=str_replace_editor>\n<parameter=command>\nview\n)\n  probe 6: EMPTY (finish_reason=stop, no content, no reasoning)\n  probe 7: EMPTY (finish_reason=stop, no content, no reasoning)\n  probe 8: CRASH (500: Failed to parse input at pos 49: <tool_call>\n<function=str_replace_editor>\n<parameter=command>\nview\n)\n  probe 9: EMPTY (finish_reason=stop, no content, no reasoning)\n  probe 10: EMPTY (finish_reason=stop, no content, no reasoning)\n\n  -> extracted: 2/10, stuck: 0/10, crash: 2/10, empty: 6/10, other: 0/10"}]}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"So out of 10 queries, we get the failure to parse twice, and then an empty\nresponse 6 times.  Something is clearly going wrong!"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"With the help of AI, I was able to attribute many of the problems to a grammar\nproblem.  The model often emits a redundant "},{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{"className":["language-text"]},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"<thinking>"}]},{"type":"text","value":" tag, which causes\nllama.cpp's parser to fail.  As you can see in this AI-generated table, this\nhappens very frequently:"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"table","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"thead","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"tr","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Model"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resolved"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Harbor exception¹"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parse-crash²"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Stuck-loop³"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Other silent-crash⁴"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"th","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Unexplained⁵"}]}]}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"tbody","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"tr","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"BF16"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"173"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"35"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"144"}]}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"td","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":